WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.061
Kusheh en welkom to SaloneHCM employee self-service training.

2
00:00:04.061 --> 00:00:15.370
Dis short session go show yu everything wey yu able do by yuself — see yu payslip dem, request leave, record attendance, en check yu details — without wait na line na di H R office.

3
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:19.576
Sign in with di work email en password wey H R gi yu.

4
00:00:19.576 --> 00:00:23.905
If yu forget yu password, yu administrator able reset am quick quick.

5
00:00:23.905 --> 00:00:26.666
Mek wi sign in as Joseph, one civil servant.

6
00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.241
Di self-service page na yu home.

7
00:00:30.241 --> 00:00:35.281
Yu payslip dem de list with gross pay, deduction dem, en net pay for every month.

8
00:00:35.281 --> 00:00:45.362
Open any one for see di full breakdown — yu P A Y E tax, yu NASSIT contribution, any loan repayment — en download di P D F for yu record or bank loan application.

9
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:51.581
Yu need time off? Go leave, press new request, pick yu date dem en leave type, den submit.

10
00:00:51.581 --> 00:00:57.326
Yu manager go know one time, en yu able watch di status change from pending to approved right ya.

11
00:00:57.326 --> 00:01:01.058
Yu remaining balance de always show, so no guessing game no de.

12
00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:06.584
Na di attendance page yu de clock in en out, en review yu own history.

13
00:01:06.584 --> 00:01:13.890
If something look wrong — like missed clock-out — tell yu H R officer en den able correct am, en di correction de log.

14
00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:18.863
Na dat — payslip, leave, en attendance, all na yu own hand.

15
00:01:18.863 --> 00:01:26.578
If yu no sure about anything, di Training Center get quick reference card wey den make just for employee dem. Tenki for watch.
